    {
      "text": "men … will scourge you in their synagogues, Matt. 10:17 (Mark 13:9; Luke 21:12). he taught them in their synagogue, Matt. 13:54 (Mark 6:2; Luke 4:16). love … the chief seats in the synagogues, Matt. 23:6 (Mark 12:39; Luke 11:43; 20:46). he hath built us a synagogue, Luke 7:5. confess that he was Christ, he should be put out of the synagogue, John 9:22. lest they should be put out of the synagogue, John 12:42. I ever taught in the synagogue, John 18:20. there arose certain of the synagogue, Acts 6:9. he preached Christ in the synagogues, Acts 9:20. they preached the word of God in the synagogues, Acts 13:5. disputed he in the synagogue with the Jews, Acts 17:17. he reasoned in the synagogue, Acts 18:4. he went into the synagogue, Acts 19:8. the synagogue of Satan, Rev. 2:9 (3:9).",
